OPTIONS:

~View Stats--------Displays vital statistics of your character.
~Magic-------------Displays magic items possessed by you.
~Quit--------------Saves all data and ends game.
~Item--------------Allows use of magic items. Some items are for use while
		       fighting, and some are for use while exploring.
~Cast Spell--------Allows spells to be cast. Some spells are for use while
		       fighting, and some are for use while exploring.
~Pause-------------Stops all activity.
~Abandon Treasure--Allows you to drop all coins, reducing player weight.
~Enter delay-------Delays printing so that you may enter many movement commands.
~@,#---------------Changes color of foreground, background.
~O-----------------Turns sound on/off.
~Take pill---------Allows you to take any pills you have found.
~Wand--------------Lets you use any wand you have found.
~ESC---------------Switches between movement modes.

~FOR  MORE  HELP  PRESS:

~1....Objectives            2....The Maps, Moving    3....The Town
4....Player Statistics     5....Spells and Magic    6....Survival Tips
7....How to Fight

~Press any other key to return to the game.
